title: NPC_Dialogue
---
<<declare $trust = 0>>
Blacksmith: Greetings, Are you here to buy something?
-> Greet them warmly
    <<set $trust += 1>>
    You: Hello! What wares do you have?
    Blacksmith: Sadly, none at the moment I hope you actually would not ask.
    <<jump Wares>>
-> Tell them no
    You: No thank you.
    Blacksmith: Well it is your loss.
    <<jump Nah>>
===
title: Wares
---

Blacksmith: Since I don't have any stock at the moment, would you like some information?

-> Ask for details
    <<set $trust += 1>>
    <<if $trust >= 2>>
        Blacksmith: This is all a test and nothing is real. 
        Blacksmith: Next time you visit I can make sure I save you some gear.
    <<else>>
        Blacksmith: This is all a test and nothing is real.
    <<endif>>
-> No thank you
    Blacksmith: Suit yourself.

    You leave without any other exchange.
===
title: Nah
---
Blacksmith: Since there is nothing else to say bye now.

You leave without any other exchange.
===

